WEBVTT

00:05:29.733 --> 00:05:31.565
about closely held truths.

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:34.681
Everybody is impacted.

00:05:36.953 --> 00:05:39.013
And then, there's the backlash.

00:05:39.037 --> 00:05:40.585
We've all heard it.

00:05:40.609 --> 00:05:42.536
"The Me Too Movement is a witch hunt."

00:05:43.197 --> 00:05:44.347
Right?

00:05:44.371 --> 00:05:47.737
"Me Too is dismantling due process."

00:05:47.761 --> 00:05:50.459
Or, "Me Too has created a gender war."

00:05:52.467 --> 00:05:58.214
The media has been consistent
with headline after headline

00:05:58.238 --> 00:06:00.906
that frames this movement in ways
that make it difficult